<title>HONG KONG: Citibank sets warrants on HK property basket.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on HK property basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank, N.A., Hong Kong Branch said it has issued 270 million American-style call warrants on shares of a basket of five property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p>HKR International Ltd			   0.2 shares</p>
<p> Sino Land Co Ltd				 0.3  shares</p>
<p> Great Eagle Holdings Ltd		     0.05 shares</p>
<p> Paliburg Holdings Ltd			  0.2  shares</p>
<p> Century City International Holdings Ltd  0.2  shares</p>
<p>Ten warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$8.9443	    PREMIUM	 15.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1911	    GEARING	 4.93X</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$9.4150	    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD   11 MTHS FROM ISSUE DATE</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
